Updates, Content Marketing World Recap and New Study 
 ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌ ‌

Hi there,

Maddie here from Originality.AI!

We have some exciting updates to share with you today! 

* Fact-Checking Beta User Rollout

* Content Marketing World Conference Recap

* ChatGPT Browse by Bing Study

**1. Fact-Checking Beta User Rollout: **

We are happy to announce the gradual rollout of our beta testing phase
for our much anticipated

**Fact-Checking Feature** starting next week! 

Many of you have expressed interest in participating, and we appreciate
your help SO much! We cannot wait to get this feature into your hands. 

To Recap,Here's what you can expect from our Fact-Checking Feature 

**Real-time Fact Checking:** Our advanced AI will cross-reference the
information in your content, ensuring that statements are backed by
trusted sources. No cut off date! Get up to the minute facts verified.

**In Text Fact Highlighting:**Our application will detect and highlight
statements within your content by colour, giving you a visual of
potentially true and potentially false statements. 

**In App Verification Sources:** Our in App verification feature will
allow the user to click on a highlighted statement and read an
explanation on why our application believes the statement is true or
false, all while providing the user with supporting sources. 

To ensure a smooth and comprehensive testing process, we will be
contacting applicants in 

**cohorts.** This approach will allow us to collect meaningful feedback
and make necessary improvements as we progress. We are committed to
involving our users in shaping the feature's development and ensuring
its effectiveness, usefulness and desired accuracy. 

Cohort selection will be made at random and those who will be included
in the first cohort will be contacted early next week with more
information and details. 

If you have not applied to become a Beta User for the Fact-Checking
Feature and would like to participate, it's not too late to apply
below 

BETA USER APPLICATION 

**2. Content Marketing World Conference Recap:**

Last week, the Originality.AI team attended the Content Marketing World
Conference  in Washington DC,
where we had the pleasure of connecting with lots of Content Marketers
and industry experts. 

We had really great discussions about the impacts of generative AI on
the industry and received valuable feedback that reaffirmed the critical
need for reliable AI Detection, Plagiarism and Fact-Checking solutions
in the Content Marketing landscape. 

The insights we gathered from this conference have further motivated us
to enhance our

**Editorial Toolset** to support content creators and publishers in
maintaining content integrity.

We feel super grateful to have had this opportunity and are looking
forward to returning next year!

James and Maddie representing Originality.AI in Washington DC at Content
Marketing World 2023 

**3. ChatGPT Browse With Bing Study: **

OpenAI has re-launched ChatGPT Browse with Bing. In our New Study,
we
found that 47% of the Top 100 Websites have blocked ChatGPT Browse with
Bing!

**The most popular websites that ChatGPT CAN NOT browse include:**

* Facebook.com

* Google.com

* Instagram.com

* Pinterest.com

* Amazon.com

* Linkedin.com

* Twitter.com

****The most popular websites that ChatGPT CAN browse include:*****
YouTube

* Wikipedia

* TikTok

* Reddit

To read the full study, click the link below 

Read Full Study Here

  

Thank you for being a part of the Originality.AI community and for your
ongoing support.

Stay tuned for further updates, and please feel free to reach out if you
have any questions or feedback. We value your input and look forward to
working together to make Originality.AI the best it can be! 

Cheers,

Sent to: patriogabrielpatdu@gmail.com

Unsubscribe

Jon Gillham, 1 First Street Suite #220, Collingwood, Ontario L9Y 1A1, Canada
